Reason: the external plan's K3 context ablation on the released KGPFN (2026-09-02): expose context_label_correction as a flag (upstream default True; off, the transformer sees exactly the sampled labels) and add context_shuffle_labels, which permutes each query's context labels among its rows with a seeded generator right before the context cache is built. Applies after 0001-0005 (0003 creates the config it edits). Default values leave the run byte-identical to before.

diff --git a/config/script/eval_zero_shot.yaml b/config/script/eval_zero_shot.yaml
--- a/config/script/eval_zero_shot.yaml	2026-09-02 11:43:44.520819774 +0200
